{"id":"d4e679f6e0553b02","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-termpartition.md","title":"Disjoint term branching for zero equations","display":"thm-termpartition — Disjoint term branching for zero equations","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-termpartition","aliases":["27-thm-termpartition"],"display":"thm-termpartition — Disjoint term branching for zero equations","depends_on":[],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§2.5.1","source_printed_pages":"83,84","source_pdf_pages":"107,108","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-termpartition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-termpartition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-termpartition — Disjoint term branching for zero equations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.5.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"83,84"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"107,108"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,p\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n,p\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\le n\">\\(p\\le n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf i:[p]\\to[n]\">\\(\\mathbf i:[p]\\to[n]\\)</span> 单射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_j=\\mathbf i(j)\">\\(i_j=\\mathbf i(j)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathbb B^p\">\\(b\\in\\mathbb B^p\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_j:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(\\ell_j:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in[p]\">\\(j\\in[p]\\)</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(C:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span> 由下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(C(a)\\le f(a))\">\\(\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(C(a)\\le f(a))\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell_j(a)\\coloneqq b_j a_{i_j}+(1-b_j)(1-a_{i_j})\\quad(j\\in[p],\\ a\\in\\mathbb B^n),\\qquad C(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{j=1}^p\\ell_j(a)\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell_j(a)\\coloneqq b_j a_{i_j}+(1-b_j)(1-a_{i_j})\\quad(j\\in[p],\\ a\\in\\mathbb B^n),\\qquad C(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{j=1}^p\\ell_j(a)\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Z_k\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid f(a)=0\\land\\ell_k(a)=0\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k-1\\}\\;\\ell_j(a)=1\\}\\quad(k\\in[p]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Z_k\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid f(a)=0\\land\\ell_k(a)=0\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k-1\\}\\;\\ell_j(a)=1\\}\\quad(k\\in[p]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid f(a)=0\\}=\\bigcup_{k=1}^p Z_k,\\qquad\\forall k,l\\in[p]\\;(k\\ne l\\Rightarrow Z_k\\cap Z_l=\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid f(a)=0\\}=\\bigcup_{k=1}^p Z_k,\\qquad\\forall k,l\\in[p]\\;(k\\ne l\\Rightarrow Z_k\\cap Z_l=\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任何零解都使项 C 为零，故按它的第一个零文字唯一地分入一个分支。与逐变量二叉分支不同，这个机制一次产生 p 个互斥子问题；正负文字都由统一的值函数处理，避免把负文字的固定值写反。空项被明确排除，因其存在时原零方程已经不一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,p\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\le n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf i:[p]\\to[n]","display":false},{"tex":"i_j=\\mathbf i(j)","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathbb B^p","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_j:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in[p]","display":false},{"tex":"C:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(C(a)\\le f(a))","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_j(a)\\coloneqq b_j a_{i_j}+(1-b_j)(1-a_{i_j})\\quad(j\\in[p],\\ a\\in\\mathbb B^n),\\qquad C(a)\\coloneqq\\prod_{j=1}^p\\ell_j(a)\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"Z_k\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid f(a)=0\\land\\ell_k(a)=0\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k-1\\}\\;\\ell_j(a)=1\\}\\quad(k\\in[p]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid f(a)=0\\}=\\bigcup_{k=1}^p Z_k,\\qquad\\forall k,l\\in[p]\\;(k\\ne l\\Rightarrow Z_k\\cap Z_l=\\varnothing).","display":true}],"bytes":1923,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-termpartition|thm-termpartition — Disjoint term branching for zero equations]]"}],"outgoing":[]}